    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Durable by design",
      "items": [
        "Temporal resumes long-running dummy work after a worker or container interruption.",
        "Canonical checkpoints, retry limits, backoff, timeouts, and dead letters remain in PostgreSQL."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Governed before effects",
      "items": [
        "Permission scopes, approvals, policy references, dry-run, budget reservation, and cost hooks guard execution.",
        "Audit, provenance, idempotency, reconciliation, and OpenTelemetry-compatible trace identities are retained."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Ready for later providers",
      "items": [
        "Storage, workflows, agents, model access, MCP, A2A, and plugins are project-owned versioned contracts.",
